#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:4
#: 2d6ebf798b6848d8822e3a3e6ec83815
msgid "Barometer (external)"
msgstr "气压计（外部）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:12
#: 4fde676830314347b6ac80d5225bfbfc
msgid ""
"Most autopilots include a barometer directly on the autopilot but attaching "
"an external barometer can be useful in order to place the barometer away "
"from air pressure disturbances.  It can also allow monitoring the "
"environmental or an internal component's temperature within a typical range "
"of -40 - +85°C."
msgstr ""
"大多数飞控已直接集成气压计，但连接外部气压计可将其放置在远离气压干扰的位置。它还可以在 -40 至 +85°C "
"的典型温度范围内监测环境温度或内部组件温度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:16
#: a66b0eba4dce42ea836b614302d016e8
msgid ""
"Copter users can partially reduce the effect of air pressure disurbances by "
"enabling :ref:`Ground Effect Compensation <Copter:ground-effect-"
"compensation>`"
msgstr ""
"Copter 用户可以通过启用 :ref:`地面效应补偿 <Copter:ground-effect-compensation>` "
"来部分减少气压干扰的影响"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:19
#: c425ebab2e1b40cca29c1e363b7aa5f6
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:21
#: 6771554ec8fb4053b0d58830fbf59d99
msgid ""
"`Beyond Robotix Air Data Module (Amphenol AUAV) "
"<https://www.beyondrobotix.com/products/air-data-module>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Beyond Robotix 空中数据模块（Amphenol AUAV） "
"<https://www.beyondrobotix.com/products/air-data-module>`_"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:22
#: 08c191ef4c844e76970ba295c734ff70
msgid ""
"`MS5611 from Drotek <https://drotek.com/shop/en/imu/44-ms5611-pressure-"
"barometric-board.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Drotek MS5611 <https://drotek.com/shop/en/imu/44-ms5611-pressure-"
"barometric-board.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:23
#: d0b68e0f6f13467b979d798d64794870
msgid "`BMP280 I2C from Adafruit <https://www.adafruit.com/product/2651>`__"
msgstr "`Adafruit BMP280 I2C <https://www.adafruit.com/product/2651>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:26
#: b87065a2c1624d4bb1df3666a55b16f7
msgid "Connecting and Configuring"
msgstr "连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:28
#: 0e6868d0d8b14be1a2a9e9a0ab71f393
msgid "Connect the barometer to the autopilot's I2C port as shown below"
msgstr "将气压计连接到飞控的 I2C 端口，如下图所示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:34
#: 9cdab2264dd14b3ca0f5a9053b09b735
msgid ""
"On the top of the Drotek MS5611 board, the \"I2C\" jumper should be "
"soldered.  Look for \"I2C/SPI\" written on the board."
msgstr "在 Drotek MS5611 板的顶部，应焊接「I2C」跳线。在板上查找「I2C/SPI」字样。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:40
#: 2e50af5a8116426d91d54a4439a16006
msgid ""
":ref:`BARO_PROBE_EXT <BARO_PROBE_EXT>` to 4 for the Drotek MS5611 or 2 for "
"the Adafruit BMP280.  Reboot the autopilot after changing this parameter."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`BARO_PROBE_EXT <BARO_PROBE_EXT>` 设置为 4（Drotek MS5611）或 2（Adafruit "
"BMP280）。修改此参数后重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:41
#: ee5c6421494b45ba848b3feb8677ffb0
msgid ""
":ref:`BARO_PRIMARY <BARO_PRIMARY>` to 1 to use the external barometer as the"
" primary"
msgstr "将 :ref:`BARO_PRIMARY <BARO_PRIMARY>` 设置为 1 以使用外部气压计作为主气压计"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:44
#: 79f44ab848494d748ab186e944cf6c1c
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:50
#: 266eff7824ab4b59877e534fc795ab9c
msgid ""
"Real-time pressure and temperature from the barometer are sent to the ground"
" station.  If using Mission Planner they are visible on the Flight Data >> "
"Status tab, look for \"press_abs2\" and \"press_temp2\"."
msgstr ""
"气压计的实时气压和温度数据会发送到地面站。若使用 Mission Planner，可在「飞行数据 >> "
"状态」选项卡中查看，搜索「press_abs2」和「press_temp2」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:52
#: c963090a079f4b46ae7e80f1891404d5
msgid ""
"Mission Planner's MAVLink Inspector can also be used to view the data.  From"
" the Flight Data screen press Ctrl-F, then push the \"MAVLink In\" button "
"and then expand the view and look for SCALED_PRESSURE2."
msgstr ""
"也可使用 Mission Planner 的 MAVLink 检查器查看数据。在飞行数据界面按 Ctrl-F，点击「MAVLink "
"In」按钮，展开视图后查找 SCALED_PRESSURE2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-baro-external.rst:59
#: 21926cbe69a84c648e99233a36d61edf
msgid ""
"If using ArduPilot onboard OSD, the secondary barometer's temperature "
"reading can be displayed using the OSDn_BTEMP panel."
msgstr "若使用 ArduPilot 板载 OSD，可使用 OSDn_BTEMP 面板显示副气压计的温度读数。"
